  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the preparation for Sida core support to BIRN media network, a need to provide specific advisory support to BIRN in elaborating their results framework was identified. The framework agreement for RBM support (InDevelop/Joakin Anger) was used.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">iVid beredningen av st&#xF6;d till medien&#xE4;tverket BIRN, befanns behov av att bist&#xE5; BIRN att utarbeta sitt resultatramverk. Sidas ramavtal med InDevelop (Joakim Anger) f&#xF6;r RBM st&#xF6;d anv&#xE4;nds.</narrative>
